#==============================================================================================
#
#   interpolation_6 - CSS interpolation: composition (add and accumulate)
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/CSS/Interpolation.cpp (lines 2253-2677), by region p4a: the
#       composition of an animated value onto an underlying value for the add and accumulate
#       composite operations: grid track lists, mixed numeric values (a calc() sum), and
#       composite_value by type (dimensions, basic shapes, border image slices and radii,
#       edges, flex, functions, integers, numbers, OpenType tags, percentages, positions,
#       radial sizes, value lists and filter value lists).
